        18("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Authorization Service</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic module]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Builds row, column, role,<br />purpose, and policy scope<br />from trusted identity and<br />versioned grants.</div>")
        style 18 fill:#92400e,stroke:#662c09,color:#ffffff
        19("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Manager Input Service</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic module]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Receives questions,<br />priorities, configuration<br />changes, uploads, decisions,<br />and organization changes.</div>")
        style 19 fill:#1d4ed8,stroke:#143697,color:#ffffff
        21("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Query Gateway</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic query execution]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Executes registered tools and<br />constrained read-only SQL<br />with RLS, timeout, row<br />limits, and audit.</div>")
        style 21 fill:#92400e,stroke:#662c09,color:#ffffff
        22("<div style='font-weight: bold'>SQL AST Guard</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: SQL parser and policy]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Allows one SELECT statement<br />over approved relations,<br />columns, joins, and<br />functions. It rejects DDL,<br />DML, SET, COPY, and unsafe<br />calls.</div>")
        style 22 fill:#92400e,stroke:#662c09,color:#ffffff
        23("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Report and Dashboard API</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic module]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reads published reports,<br />dashboard data, workflow<br />observations, and explicit<br />failure states with a fresh<br />access check.</div>")
        style 23 fill:#1d4ed8,stroke:#143697,color:#ffffff
        25("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Bounded Agent Orchestrator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: LangGraph runtime]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Runs one bounded agent<br />through the report graph and<br />interactive graph. It cannot<br />create numbers, grants,<br />signals, or actions.</div>")
        style 25 fill:#a21caf,stroke:#71137a,color:#ffffff
        26("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Evidence Service</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic module]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Builds authorized and<br />traceable evidence bundles<br />before any model call.</div>")
        style 26 fill:#92400e,stroke:#662c09,color:#ffffff
        27("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Model Gateway</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Provider-neutral model client]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Applies token, time, retry,<br />and daily cost limits. It is<br />the only path to the LLM<br />Provider.</div>")
        style 27 fill:#a21caf,stroke:#71137a,color:#ffffff
        28("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Output Validator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic validator]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Checks numbers, query<br />references, evidence, access,<br />JSON schema, tone,<br />recurrence, and report<br />content.</div>")
        style 28 fill:#334155,stroke:#232d3b,color:#ffffff
        29("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Audit Service</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Deterministic module]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Records query, model, access,<br />validation, publication,<br />cost, and failure evidence<br />with restricted visibility.</div>")
        style 29 fill:#334155,stroke:#232d3b,color:#ffffff
